39
00:01:41,476 --> 00:01:43,102
<i>Hey! It's no joke!</i>

40
00:01:43,186 --> 00:01:44,354
<i>This is nice.</i>

41
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:45,730
<i>I knew it.</i>

42
00:01:45,814 --> 00:01:46,689
