199
00:10:08,608 --> 00:10:10,568
I don't think he likes me.

200
00:10:10,651 --> 00:10:13,154
I do. I thought you were a man earlier.

201
00:10:13,237 --> 00:10:14,113
Because I'm so tall?

202
00:10:14,196 --> 00:10:16,073
Your feet looked as big as mine.

203
00:10:16,157 --> 00:10:18,326
What's wrong with you? Geez.

204
00:10:18,826 --> 00:10:20,161
I'm sensitive about that.

205
00:10:20,244 --> 00:10:22,622
Why? You don't like your feet?

206
00:10:23,664 --> 00:10:24,915
- Got it.
- Okay.

207
00:10:26,167 --> 00:10:27,418
- I mean…
- What?

208
00:10:28,294 --> 00:10:30,129
Why do I feel so awkward?

209
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:36,844
Well, in Season 1,
weren't you like that with Jin?

210
00:10:36,927 --> 00:10:39,055
So he was practically the leader.

211
00:10:39,138 --> 00:10:41,390
- I mean, it was…
- And I feel like

212
00:10:41,474 --> 00:10:44,685
