225
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:28,604
A VERSATILE ALL-ROUNDER
ACROSS MULTIPLE GENRES

226
00:11:30,481 --> 00:11:31,816
It's good to see him again.

227
00:11:31,899 --> 00:11:33,109
Hello.

228
00:11:33,192 --> 00:11:34,902
- Hello.
- Hello.

229
00:11:34,985 --> 00:11:36,278
- Hello.
- Hello.

230
00:11:37,363 --> 00:11:38,364
Hello.

231
00:11:38,447 --> 00:11:39,907
- It's good to see you.
- Hello.

232
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:41,367
It's been a while.

233
00:11:41,450 --> 00:11:43,661
