so it was hard for me to approach them.

237
00:11:57,633 --> 00:11:58,676
Good to see you.

238
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,678
- It's been a while.
- I brought some pastries.

239
00:12:00,761 --> 00:12:03,973
I thought it'd be nice to talk
while having this.

240
00:12:04,056 --> 00:12:04,974
- Thank you.
- Please.

241
00:12:05,808 --> 00:12:06,892
- Right.
- Have a seat.

242
00:12:06,976 --> 00:12:08,853
This is so awkward.

243
00:12:10,479 --> 00:12:11,689
Gosh, this is…

244
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:13,441
